    narr:narration """The architectural stratum is currently defined by the implementation of a [cryptographic deployment gate](narr:Narrative_SignedManifestDeployGate), which mandates verified release integrity across all environments. This shift, formalized in August 2026, reflects a move toward rigorous, authority-ranked governance of the deployment pipeline. The supporting expressions, including [concrete base probes](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) and [abstract technical specifications](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3), establish a consistent, formal register focused on conservation and system stability. While the primary trajectory emphasizes standardized, legitimate control over infrastructure, the [final probe](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) introduces a distinct shift in value orientation, moving from pure conservation to self-enhancement, suggesting that the architecture is being leveraged not only for security but as a mechanism for internal system optimization.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedManifestDeployGate> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Deployment now gated on cryptographic proof of release integrity" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SignedManifestDeployGate> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Tension between conservation-focused stability and self-enhancement objectives in system governance." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Divergence between concrete, present-state implementation and abstract, architectural design modeling." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
